abstract: >-
  Compact code, accessioned public inputs, derived tables and diagnostic plots
  used to reconstruct a murine retroposition event that produced Dnaaf6rt and
  altered Alyreffm1 transcript architecture. Manuscript figure assets are not
  part of this release.
keywords:
